The '''gorajo hoardstalker''' is a [[gorajo]] located within the [[Gorajo Hoardstalker Dungeon]] in the [[Meilyr district]] of [[Prifddinas]], which requires level 95 [[Dungeoneering]] to access. After unlocking access to the resource dungeon, he can also be found next to [[Thok of Daemonheim]] at [[Daemonheim]].

Gorajo hoardstalker can occasionally be found at [[Manor Farm]], asking for help with a medium [[Farming request]].

