==Development history==
===Claim card===
He used to give players a special [[Gorajo cards|card]] daily. These cards are similar to the versions his [[Gorajo hoardstalker (Sinkholes)|sinkhole counterpart]] offers, the cards provide a different bonus while training Dungeoneering in Daemonheim instead. They are used by activating them while in a dungeon and have different effects depending on what card is used. Players can have only one solo card and one team card at a time. A new card of each type cannot be obtained until the previous one of that type is used or destroyed.

The "Claim card" feature was disabled on the [[Dungeoneering Remastered]] update, attempting to doing so will prompt a message "Nothing interesting happens".

